      {
        "id": "blk-summary-text",
        "type": "text",
        "data": {
          "markdown": "In Q1 2026 we ran a comprehensive survey with **1,482 active US customers**. The overall satisfaction score rose from 76 to **83** (out of 100), an improvement of 9.2% versus Q4 2025.\n\nThe headline finding: *strong gains on the East and West coasts*, alongside a small dip in the Mountain region. The regional gap warrants attention in Q2."
        }
      },
