        "data": {
          "markdown": "- **Sampling method:** random stratified sampling by US census region\n- **Instrument:** online questionnaire, 18 items\n- **Respondents:** N = 1,482\n- **Response rate:** 38%\n- **Collection period:** January 15 – March 28, 2026"
